    {
      "type": "spotlight",
      "item": "tribalpower:loom_anchor",
      "text": [
        "The Loom-stitchers' craft, and the endgame generator. The Loom Anchor pays for a complete camp: **1 Pulse a second** for every distinct totem voice within **8 blocks**, up to six.",
        "It holds **1,000 Pulse**."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Counting voices",
      "text": [
        "It counts voices, not totems: six Earth totems are one voice. Quiet totems still count; empty air does not.",
        "A live [Ley Binding](world_rites) on any totem near it **doubles** the rate.",
        "Kinship Totems lend their tribe's element into the same six-voice set. They are not a seventh voice: a Grit-singer kinship beside an Earth totem adds nothing.",
        "Ranking it in Echo Attune, Bind, then Manifest adds **15% Pulse a second** per rank, not the workshop 118%."
      ]
    },
